---
title: Hex frequencies
tags: tools
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% from "macros/delimiter.njk" import delimiter %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    For a given string of Hexadecimal, list out the frequencies of various hex combinations. This can be useful when looking at data-driven puzzles, and trying to find recognizable patterns.
</p>
<p class="px-2">
    The dropdown allows you to select a delimiter, which is how your hex values are split up and joined together. The default is a space, you can select no delimiter if your hex contains no spaces. This will default the split to every 2 characters. Negative numbers are allowed.
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
<div class="col">
    <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label visually-hidden">Hex frequencies</span>
        <div class="card-body text-center">
            <label for="{{ filename }}Text" class="visually-hidden">Hex characters to check</label>
            <textarea placeholder="Enter some hex characters and click the 'Generate' button below" rows="6" id="{{ filename }}Text" class="form-control word-freqs" autocomplete="off"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer py-3">
            <div class="text-center mb-4 g-0">
                <div class="row row-cols-2 g-md-0 gx-0 gy-2">
                    <div class="col col-12 col-md-auto">
                        <div class="input-group w-auto">
                            <label class="input-group-text" for="{{ filename }}Delimiter">Delimiter</label>
                            {{ delimiter(filename) }}
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-md btn-convrtr" id="{{ filename }}Decode" title="Generate hex frequencies">Generate</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-auto flex-fill">
                        <div class="row row-cols-auto g-0">
                            {% include "components/select-copy-dl.njk" %}
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <hr />
            <div class="">
                <div class="grid g-4 my-1 data-to-copy active convrtr-results" id="{{ filename }}Results"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endcall %}
